# validation/results/scorecard.json. Needs the prepared real validation data and the checkpoints. Generated by
# common/tools/reproduce_validation.py. Run on an idle GPU:
#   CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 bash model-lumpi-track/routed-g8/test/reproduce_s6_validation.sh
# The inference commands are independent: `python common/tools/reproduce_validation.py model-lumpi-track/routed-g8 --tag s6 --jobs`
